---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /index.html
title: "The Linkker blog: useful websites, free tools and smarter saving"
seoTitle: "Linkker blog: the best free websites, AI tools and link-saving tips"
noSuffix: true
description: "Hand-picked lists of genuinely useful free websites and AI tools, plus practical ways to save, sort and find the links that matter."
---
<section class="wrap blog-head">
  <p class="eyebrow">The Linkker blog</p>
  <h1>Useful corners of the internet, <span class="mark">worth saving.</span></h1>
  <p class="lead">Hand-picked free websites and AI tools that do one job well, and practical ways to keep track of the good links you find.</p>
</section>

<section class="wrap">
  {% if collections.posts.length %}
  <ul class="post-grid">
    {% for p in collections.posts %}
    <li>
      <a class="post-card" href="{{ p.url | blogUrl }}">
        {% if p.data.hero %}<img src="/blog{{ p.data.hero }}" alt="" width="1200" height="630" loading="{{ 'eager' if loop.index < 4 else 'lazy' }}" decoding="async">{% endif %}
        <span class="pc-body">
          <small>{{ p.data.kicker or "Linkker picks" }} · {{ p.date | readableDate }}</small>
          <b>{{ p.data.title }}</b>
          <span class="pc-desc">{{ p.data.description }}</span>
        </span>
      </a>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  {% else %}
  <p class="lead">The first lists are on their way.</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>
<script type="application/ld+json">
{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Blog","name":"The Linkker blog","url":"{{ site.url }}/blog",
 "publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Linkker","url":"{{ site.url }}/"}}
</script>
